{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2019-10-09 22:30:00', 'title': 'FORD MOTOR COMPANY DECLARES FOURTH QUARTER REGULAR DIVIDEND ON CLASS B AND COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON DEC. 2, 2019', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF FORD MOTOR COMPANY DECLARED A FOURTH QUARTER REGULAR DIVIDEND OF $0.15 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY’S OUTSTANDING CLASS B AND COMMON STOCK. THE FOURTH QUARTER DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON DEC. 2, 2019, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON OCT. 22, 2019.'}